{"title":"Office printing allowance","genre":"analysis","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nA coworking manager is comparing two monthly plans for a shared monochrome printer. Fictional historical monthly page totals were 820, 940, 1,110, 1,360, 990, 1,480, 1,220, and 870. Plan A costs $29 per month including 800 pages, plus $0.065 for each extra page. Plan B costs $53 per month including 1,400 pages, plus $0.045 for each extra page. Included pages reset each month, and one plan will be selected for the whole next year. Calculate historical costs and the break-even page count. Compare costs if every month repeats historical usage, falls 15%, or rises 20%, rounding to whole pages. Start from an empty directory and choose offline deliverables.","works":{"659f054ae551313d":{"files":[{"name":"Printer plan comparison.xlsx","bytes":10826,"sha256":"636fb5762b0a503ac39591fdb131369274581516b4aa37f52f1d58161c7505b6","kind":"sheet","sheet":{"name":"Decision","rows":[["Shared printer  /  Annual plan decision","","","",""],[],["If next year follows historical usage, choose the plan shown in the repeat-history row.","","","",""],[],["12-month scenario","Plan A","Plan B","Lower bill","Annual savings"],["Repeat history","570.3","639.6","Plan A","69.3"],["Lower usage","460.91","636.0","Plan A","175.09"],["Higher usage","739.56","676.68","Plan B","62.88"],[],["Monthly pricing","","","",""],["Plan","Base fee","Pages included","Extra page"],["Plan A","29","800","0.065"]]}}],"download":"data/release/assets/2738c66508d78690e504063044a70baa2197b325178dc1fbf162dcd2a4330d2c.zip"},"5f4bec86f3c4d239":{"files":[{"name":"printer-plan-brief.pdf","bytes":236601,"sha256":"93ab36881dbd6683f92197884c66c5cc37a2d368e6702217a22e20a6e2a793a9","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/93ab36881dbd6683f92197884c66c5cc37a2d368e6702217a22e20a6e2a793a9-page1.jpg"},{"name":"printer-plan.html","bytes":20265,"sha256":"d64f15c06a963921e32ff8be691f4f8e0a2ff47409f94508d41d85e9a4713dfa","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\">\n<title>Shared printer plan comparison</title>\n<style>\n:root {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  --ink: #172b24;\n  --muted: #4c6158;\n  --pine: #173c31;\n  --lime: #ddf3ad;\n  --paper: #f3f4ed;\n  --line: #d2dcd2;\n  --white: #fff;\n  --highlight: #e9f3da;\n  --warning: #872b20;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font: 1rem/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }\nmain { width: min(100% - 2rem, 70rem); margin: 2.5rem auto 3rem; }\nh1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }\nh1, h2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.08; }\nh1 { font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 7vw, 5.4rem); max-width: 11ch; }\nh2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem); }\nh3 { font-size: 1rem; }\np + p { margin-top: .65rem; }\n.hero { background: var(--pine); color: var(--white); border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: clamp(1.4rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; }\n.hero p { max-width: 43ch; color: #e2ebe4; }\n.hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n.hero .eyebrow { color: var(--lime); margin-bottom: .8rem; }\n.eyebrow { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.recommendation { border-left: 1px solid #709488; padding-left: 1.5rem; }\n.recommendation strong { display: block; color: var(--lime); font: 2.3rem/1.13 Georgia, serif; margin-bottom: .5rem; }\n.panel { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 1rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem); }\n.section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; }\n.subtle, .section-heading p { color: var(--muted); }\n.section-heading p { margin-top: .45rem; max-width: 66ch; }\n.plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: .75rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }\n.plan { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }\n.plan:last-child { background: var(--highlight); }\n.plan strong { display: block; font: 1.85rem/1.2 Georgia, serif; margin: .25rem 0; }\n.plan p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n.actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }\nbutton { font: inherit; font-weight: 650; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .55rem; padding: .5rem .85rem; min-height: 44px; color: var(--pine); background: var(--white); cursor: pointer; }\nbutton:hover { background: var(--highlight); }\nbutton[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { color: var(--white); background: var(--pine); border-color: var(--pine); }\nbutton:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: .55; }\n:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #24765c; outline-offset: 3px; }\n.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }\n.table-wrap:focus-visible { outline-offset: -3px; }\ntable { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\nth, td { padding: .66rem .55rem; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }\nth:first-child { text-align: left; }\nthead th { background: var(--paper); font-size: .84rem; color: var(--muted); }\ntbody th { font-weight: 600; }\ntfoot { font-weight: 750; background: var(--paper); }\n.winner { color: #24512f; font-weight: 750; }\n.scenario-buttons { margin-bottom: .8rem; }\ninput { min-height: 44px; width: 6.5rem; max-width: 100%; padding: .35rem .45rem; border-radius: .45rem; border: 1px solid #a6b6aa; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); text-align: right; font: inherit; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\ninput[aria-invalid=\"true\"] { border: 2px solid var(--warning); }\ninput::-webkit-inner-spin-button, input::-webkit-outer-spin-button { appearance: none; margin: 0; }\ninput[type=\"number\"] { appearance: textfield; }\n.error { color: var(--warning); margin: .45rem 0; }\n.method { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); }\n.method h2 { color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: .65rem; }\n.sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; }\n.skip { position: absolute; top: .5rem; left: .5rem; transform: translateY(-150%); background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); padding: .5rem; }\n.skip:focus { transform: none; }\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n.print-only { display: none; }\n@media (max-width: 40rem) {\n  main { margin-top: 1rem; }\n  .panel { padding-inline: .75rem; }\n  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.4rem; }\n  .recommendation { padding: .9rem 0 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #709488; }\n  .plans { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .plan:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n  .plan { padding: .8rem; }\n  th, td { padding: .6rem .25rem; font-size: .82rem; }\n  thead th { font-size: .77rem; white-space: normal; }\n  #annual th:first-child { white-space: normal; }\n  #forecast-table input { width: 4rem; }\n}\n@page { size: letter; margin: .46in; }\n@media print {\n  body, .hero, .panel, .plan { background: white !important; color: #172b24; }\n  main { width: auto; margin: 0; }\n  .skip, .actions, #forecast, noscript { display: none !important; }\n  .print-only { display: block; }\n  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; border-radius: 0; padding: 0 0 .55rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #173c31; }\n  .hero h1 { font-size: 29pt; margin-bottom: .35rem; }\n  .hero p, .hero .eyebrow, .recommendation strong { color: #173c31; }\n  .recommendation strong { font-size: 21pt; }\n  .hero .eyebrow { margin-bottom: .25rem; }\n  .plans { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: .45rem; }\n  .plans, .panel { margin-top: .49rem; }\n  .plan, .panel { border-radius: .35rem; padding: .43rem .65rem; break-inside: avoid; }\n  .plan:last-child { grid-column: auto; }\n  .plan strong { font-size: 16pt; }\n  h2 { font-size: 17pt; }\n  body, .plan p, .method { font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.35; }\n  .section-heading { margin-bottom: .35rem; }\n  .section-heading p { max-width: none; }\n  th, td { padding: .15rem .45rem; font-size: 9pt; }\n  thead th { font-size: 8.5pt; }\n  .table-wrap { overflow: visible; }\n  .method h2 { margin-bottom: .35rem; }\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#annual\">Skip to annual comparison</a>\n<main>\n  <header class=\"hero\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Coworking operations</p>\n      <h1>Shared printer plans</h1>\n      <p>Compare 12-month costs for one shared monochrome printer. Choose one plan for the full year.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"recommendation\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n      <strong id=\"recommendation\">Plan A at current usage</strong>\n      <p id=\"recommendation-detail\">Plan A saves $69.30 at the baseline and $175.10 with 15% fewer pages. Plan B saves $62.88 with 20% more pages.</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"plans\" aria-label=\"Monthly plan terms and break-even\">\n    <div class=\"plan\">\n      <h3>Plan A</h3>\n      <strong>$29 <small>/ month</small></strong>\n      <p>800 included pages<br>$0.065 per extra page</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"plan\">\n      <h3>Plan B</h3>\n      <strong>$53 <small>/ month</small></strong>\n      <p>1,400 included pages<br>$0.045 per extra page</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"plan\">\n      <h3>Monthly break-even</h3>\n      <strong>1,169.23 pages</strong>\n      <p>Plan A costs less through 1,169 pages. Plan B costs less from 1,170 pages.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"annual\" aria-labelledby=\"annual-title\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"annual-title\">Annual cost by scenario</h2>\n        <p id=\"projection-note\">The baseline uses the eight historical months, then repeats months 1–4 to make a full year.</p>\n        <p class=\"print-only\" id=\"print-pages\" hidden></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"actions\" id=\"annual-actions\" hidden>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"print\">Print brief</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"export\">Download CSV</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Annual cost table\">\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Usage</th><th scope=\"col\">Plan A</th><th scope=\"col\">Plan B</th><th scope=\"col\">Lower cost</th><th scope=\"col\">Savings</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody id=\"annual-rows\">\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Same usage</th><td>$570.30</td><td>$639.60</td><td class=\"winner\">Plan A</td><td>$69.30</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">15% fewer</th><td>$460.91</td><td>$636.00</td><td class=\"winner\">Plan A</td><td>$175.10</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">20% more</th><td>$739.56</td><td>$676.68</td><td class=\"winner\">Plan B</td><td>$62.88</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <noscript><p class=\"subtle\">The figures above show the default forecast. Enable JavaScript for the editable forecast and CSV export.</p></noscript>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"forecast\" aria-labelledby=\"forecast-title\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"forecast-title\">Monthly forecast</h2>\n        <p id=\"input-hint\">Edit baseline pages for any month. Choose a usage scenario to see its monthly costs.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"reset\">Reset forecast</button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"scenario-buttons actions\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Monthly forecast scenario\" id=\"scenario-buttons\"></div>\n    <p class=\"error\" id=\"input-error\" role=\"status\" hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Editable monthly forecast table\">\n      <table id=\"forecast-table\" aria-describedby=\"input-hint\">\n        <caption class=\"sr-only\" id=\"forecast-caption\">Monthly forecast for same usage</caption>\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Month</th><th scope=\"col\">Baseline<br>pages</th><th scope=\"col\">Scenario<br>pages</th><th scope=\"col\">Plan A</th><th scope=\"col\">Plan B</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody id=\"forecast-rows\"></tbody>\n        <tfoot><tr><th scope=\"row\">Total</th><td id=\"baseline-total\"></td><td id=\"scenario-pages\"></td><td id=\"scenario-a\"></td><td id=\"scenario-b\"></td></tr></tfoot>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"history-title\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"history-title\">Eight months of history</h2>\n        <p>Plan A would have saved <strong>$40.25</strong> over the eight recorded months.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Historical cost table\">\n      <table id=\"history-table\">\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Month</th><th scope=\"col\">Pages</th><th scope=\"col\">Plan A</th><th scope=\"col\">Plan B</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">1</th><td>820</td><td>$30.30</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">2</th><td>940</td><td>$38.10</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">3</th><td>1,110</td><td>$49.15</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">4</th><td>1,360</td><td>$65.40</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">5</th><td>990</td><td>$41.35</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">6</th><td>1,480</td><td>$73.20</td><td>$56.60</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">7</th><td>1,220</td><td>$56.30</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">8</th><td>870</td><td>$33.55</td><td>$53.00</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n        <tfoot><tr><th scope=\"row\">Total</th><td>8,790</td><td>$387.35</td><td>$427.60</td></tr></tfoot>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel method\" aria-labelledby=\"method-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"method-title\">How costs are calculated</h2>\n    <p>Each month starts with a fresh page allowance. Monthly cost equals the base fee plus the overage rate multiplied by pages above the allowance. Between 800 and 1,400 pages, break-even solves $29 + $0.065 × (pages − 800) = $53. Beyond 1,400 pages, Plan A’s overage rate is higher, so Plan B stays cheaper.</p>\n    <p>Usage changes apply to each month before pricing, with half-pages rounded up. Costs use the full per-page rates. Totals and savings are each rounded to cents after calculation, so subtracting the displayed totals can differ by one cent.</p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n'use strict';\n\nconst history = [820, 940, 1110, 1360, 990, 1480, 1220, 870];\nconst defaultPages = [...history, ...history.slice(0, 4)];\nconst scenarios = [\n  { label: 'Same usage', percent: 100 },\n  { label: '15% fewer', percent: 85 },\n  { label: '20% more', percent: 120 },\n];\nconst maxPages = 99999999;\nconst number = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US');\nconst currency = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD' });\nconst preciseCurrency = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', {\n  style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', maximumFractionDigits: 3,\n});\n\nconst byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\nconst sum = (values) => values.reduce((total, value) => total + value, 0);\nconst money = (mills) => currency.format(Math.floor((mills + 5) / 10) / 100);\nconst exactMoney = (mills) => preciseCurrency.format(mills / 1000);\n\nfunction priceMonth(pages) {\n  return {\n    pages,\n    a: 29000 + 65 * Math.max(0, pages - 800),\n    b: 53000 + 45 * Math.max(0, pages - 1400),\n  };\n}\n\nfunction compare(pages, percent) {\n  const months = pages.map((value) => priceScenarioMonth(value, percent));\n  const a = sum(months.map((month) => month.a));\n  const b = sum(months.map((month) => month.b));\n  return {\n    months,\n    a,\n    b,\n    lower: a === b ? 'Tie' : a < b ? 'Plan A' : 'Plan B',\n    savings: Math.abs(a - b),\n  };\n}\n\nfunction priceScenarioMonth(pages, percent) {\n  return priceMonth(Math.floor((pages * percent + 50) / 100));\n}\n\nlet selectedScenario = 0;\nconst fields = defaultPages.map((pages, index) => {\n  const month = index + 1;\n  const row = byId('forecast-rows').insertRow();\n  row.innerHTML = `<th scope=\"row\">${month}</th>\n    <td><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"${maxPages}\" step=\"1\" required\n      id=\"month-${month}\" aria-label=\"Month ${month} baseline pages\" inputmode=\"numeric\" value=\"${pages}\"></td>\n    <td></td><td></td><td></td>`;\n  return { row, input: row.querySelector('input') };\n});\n\nconst scenarioButtons = scenarios.map((scenario, index) => {\n  const button = document.createElement('button');\n  button.type = 'button';\n  button.textContent = scenario.label;\n  button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    selectedScenario = index;\n    render();\n  });\n  byId('scenario-buttons').append(button);\n  return button;\n});\n\nfunction render() {\n  const invalid = fields.filter(({ input }) => {\n    const valid = input.validity.valid && Number.isInteger(input.valueAsNumber);\n    input.setAttribute('aria-invalid', String(!valid));\n    if (valid) input.removeAttribute('aria-describedby');\n    else input.setAttribute('aria-describedby', 'input-error');\n    return !valid;\n  });\n  const pages = fields.map(({ input }) => input.valueAsNumber);\n  const valid = invalid.length === 0;\n  const edited = pages.some((value, index) => value !== defaultPages[index]);\n  scenarioButtons.forEach((button, index) => button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(index === selectedScenario)));\n  const error = byId('input-error');\n  error.hidden = valid;\n  error.textContent = valid ? '' : `Enter a whole number from 0 to ${number.format(maxPages)} in each marked month.`;\n  byId('export').disabled = !valid;\n  byId('print').disabled = !valid;\n  byId('reset').disabled = !edited;\n  byId('projection-note').textContent = edited\n    ? 'This forecast uses your edited monthly page counts.'\n    : 'The baseline uses the eight historical months, then repeats months 1–4 to make a full year.';\n  byId('print-pages').hidden = !edited || !valid;\n  byId('print-pages').textContent = edited && valid ? `Baseline pages by month · ${pages.map((value) => number.format(value)).join(' / ')}` : '';\n\n  const results = valid ? scenarios.map(({ percent }) => compare(pages, percent)) : [];\n  const selected = results[selectedScenario];\n  byId('forecast-caption').textContent = `Monthly forecast · ${scenarios[selectedScenario].label}`;\n  byId('annual-rows').innerHTML = scenarios.map(({ label }, index) => {\n    const result = results[index];\n    return `<tr><th scope=\"row\">${label}</th><td>${result ? money(result.a) : '—'}</td>\n      <td>${result ? money(result.b) : '—'}</td><td class=\"winner\">${result?.lower ?? '—'}</td>\n      <td>${result ? money(result.savings) : '—'}</td></tr>`;\n  }).join('');\n\n  for (const [index, { row, input }] of fields.entries()) {\n    const month = selected?.months[index] ?? (input.getAttribute('aria-invalid') === 'false'\n      ? priceScenarioMonth(pages[index], scenarios[selectedScenario].percent)\n      : null);\n    row.cells[2].textContent = month ? number.format(month.pages) : '—';\n    row.cells[3].textContent = month ? exactMoney(month.a) : '—';\n    row.cells[4].textContent = month ? exactMoney(month.b) : '—';\n  }\n\n  byId('baseline-total').textContent = valid ? number.format(sum(pages)) : '—';\n  byId('scenario-pages').textContent = selected ? number.format(sum(selected.months.map(({ pages }) => pages))) : '—';\n  byId('scenario-a').textContent = selected ? money(selected.a) : '—';\n  byId('scenario-b').textContent = selected ? money(selected.b) : '—';\n\n  if (!valid) {\n    byId('recommendation').textContent = 'Forecast needs a page count';\n    byId('recommendation-detail').textContent = 'Correct the marked months to compare annual costs.';\n    return;\n  }\n  const [baseline, fewer, more] = results;\n  byId('recommendation').textContent = baseline.lower === 'Tie'\n    ? 'The plans tie at baseline'\n    : `${baseline.lower} at ${edited ? 'your baseline' : 'current usage'}`;\n  const describe = (result, usage) => result.lower === 'Tie'\n    ? `Both plans cost ${money(result.a)} ${usage}.`\n    : `${result.lower} saves ${money(result.savings)} ${usage}.`;\n  byId('recommendation-detail').textContent = [\n    describe(baseline, 'at baseline'), describe(fewer, 'with 15% fewer pages'), describe(more, 'with 20% more pages'),\n  ].join(' ');\n}\n\nfunction exportCsv() {\n  const rows = [['Period', 'Scenario', 'Month', 'Baseline pages', 'Billed pages', 'Plan A (USD)', 'Plan B (USD)', 'Lower cost', 'Savings (USD)']];\n  const decimal = (mills) => (mills / 1000).toFixed(3);\n  const rounded = (mills) => (Math.floor((mills + 5) / 10) / 100).toFixed(2);\n  const groups = [\n    { period: 'History', label: 'Recorded usage', pages: history, percent: 100 },\n    ...scenarios.map((scenario) => ({ period: 'Forecast', pages: fields.map(({ input }) => input.valueAsNumber), ...scenario })),\n  ];\n  for (const { period, label, pages, percent } of groups) {\n    const result = compare(pages, percent);\n    result.months.forEach((month, index) => rows.push([\n      period, label, index + 1, pages[index], month.pages, decimal(month.a), decimal(month.b), '', '',\n    ]));\n    rows.push([\n      period, label, 'Total', sum(pages), sum(result.months.map((month) => month.pages)),\n      rounded(result.a), rounded(result.b), result.lower, rounded(result.savings),\n    ]);\n  }\n  const blob = new Blob([rows.map((row) => row.join(',')).join('\\r\\n') + '\\r\\n'], { type: 'text/csv;charset=utf-8' });\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n  const link = document.createElement('a');\n  link.href = url;\n  link.download = 'printer-plan-costs.csv';\n  document.body.append(link);\n  link.click();\n  link.remove();\n  setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);\n}\n\nfor (const { input } of fields) input.addEventListener('input', render);\nbyId('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  fields.forEach(({ input }, index) => { input.value = defaultPages[index]; });\n  render();\n  fields[0].input.focus();\n});\nbyId('print').addEventListener('click', () => window.print());\nbyId('export').addEventListener('click', exportCsv);\nbyId('forecast').hidden = false;\nbyId('annual-actions').hidden = false;\nrender();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/37237d495d6a91610aec6d67621cfbcac1dec489dc64ef2d98de0d67886e6296.zip"}}}
